# Vulnerabilities the Docker build workflow (.github/workflows/docker-build.yml)
# accepts. One CVE id per line, always with a reason and an expiry date, e.g.
#
#   # not reachable: only used by the build stage; revisit 2027-01-01
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2027-01-01
#
# The list is empty on purpose: fix by updating the base image or the dependency.
